  "notes": "ALIGN (AL) now works the AutoCAD way - select objects, then click source and destination points, with OSNAP. New PDFATTACH attaches a PDF page as an underlay, and PDF2DRAWING converts a PDF into real lines, text and hatches - including the embedded images it used to skip. Attached images and PDFs are now proper drawing objects: they stay locked to the drawing when you zoom, they do not follow you into the next drawing, and you can select, move and delete them. Saving as .dwg now tells you if any change could not be written instead of leaving it out silently. Only the changed parts are downloaded, so this update is small.",
